    Verify standby before main power, then measure EPS, core, I/O and memory under
    load.

    General teaching principle: Memory and initialization workflows require
    checking power, connectivity, configuration and the authored test responses in
    the correct sequence.

    Only fresh, authoritative game evidence can establish
    that this objective is complete.'
